{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "6a765a5ec1ce7dbd7856603fd2c003565ae97b654357d260035522865a95ee30", "ja": "『結婚』について、お聞かせください", "zh": "请跟我们聊聊关于“结婚”的话题", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "85d5fa5f36804dab08b7bbfb5972818466cf5093c2db6c3bc8e3d90a228cebf7", "ja": "いよいよブライダル企画がスタート。まずは\n結婚式場からのアンケートに回答していく\nメンバー達。質問の量に圧倒されつつ、理想\nの結婚式や相手像を、想像で補い合いながら\n楽しく回答を進めていく。", "zh": "婚礼企划终于开始了。首先，成员们\n开始回答婚礼会场发来的问卷。虽然被\n问题的数量压倒，但大家一边想象着理\n想的婚礼和另一半的样子，一边互相补\n充，愉快地回答着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "15a16dd01c497cee277a2f8d6d81a66850b4fbd7b4f0c9cf02434070d0a4f639", "ja": "（ブライダル企画がスタート！　まずはアイドル達に、\nアンケートに答えてもらう事になっている）", "zh": "（婚礼企划开始！首先要让偶像们填写问卷）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "002c765828eaab0c5d68db0e234efde6519d4aeaa6215ade685e3800acb3dff4", "ja": "みんなのアンケートの回答は、式場のパンフレットや\n特設サイトに掲載される予定だそうだ。", "zh": "大家的问卷回答，预计会刊登在婚礼场地的宣传册和\n特设网站上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a9959bc6bf44b2cd8ba97188f882882f7a9693d7c7361458d3cadd96c6a2427b", "ja": "若い層に共感してもらうのが狙いだから、\n素直な気持ちで記入してくれ！", "zh": "因为目标是让年轻人产生共鸣，所以要用坦率的心情填写哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "90720c0ebd7f19989352d9d28ff009f056e87c56c7d3b89c3834526bfdc467fd", "ja": "えっ！？　ってことは、\nこの紙の束、ぜーんぶ質問ってこと！？", "zh": "诶！？也就是说，\n这一沓纸全都是问题！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "91fbd051ae5fd033d5b8542c1a0e4e375fdcae39af80f6043b750cf5b266ca54", "ja": "ウソやん……。\nこれ、分厚いスマホぐらいあるで……？", "zh": "不会吧……。\n这都跟厚厚的手机差不多了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "de6352eba8b5e1a60be8f43ecd6fa4918de57e4a56653394559260536c9fa6cb", "ja": "これでも絞った方なんだそうだ。\n結婚となると、どうしても項目が多くなるとか……。", "zh": "听说这还算是精简过的了。  \n毕竟一提到结婚，项目就难免会变多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "3f69c71014292a6ed2fd79a05fb39a8c923e2d85177b416386cdc122653d8ea6", "ja": "『Q.結婚、いつかはしたい？　するつもりはない？』\nそもそも、みたいな質問もあるんですね～。", "zh": "“Q.总有一天想结婚吗？还是不打算结婚？”\n连从根本问起的问题都有呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d6f6ba209a9907b143924513ddb5d4e51fb7bd08bfbbbb1358fe205f37b18fe4", "ja": "みんながみんな結婚する時代でもないからな。\n今の自分が想像できる回答でいいと思うよ。", "zh": "现在已经不是人人都要结婚的时代了。\n回答你现在能想象到的就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "def6165ac91f32a0b54133f405547404fc52612ec89adb7f23d21364028f1cba", "ja": "『Q.結婚するなら、どんな相手が理想？』\nうーん、理想の相手かぁ……。", "zh": "“Q.如果要结婚的话，理想的对象是哪种类型？”\n唔——理想的对象啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "e8c3f328dde33056b5ffedea9285c474eea44559f995aa5be1d0ca73a9ce5f07", "ja": "自分たち、アイドルだからね。\nこういうの、答えちゃっていいのかな？", "zh": "我们毕竟是偶像嘛。这样的事，真的可以回答吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "150959f164fa979c960055e72070921e1bf61b69d06ff6ed6b81d23820bb8977", "ja": "これこそ想像でいいんじゃないか？\n理想の、素敵な相手を思い描くような感じで……。", "zh": "这不正适合发挥想象吗？\n就想象一下自己理想中那位美好的对象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "7c9d8b0252b69ccc893916bcea22b7df66748534732af106e22b2d2e2ad575c9", "ja": "でも『Q.結婚後の理想の1日を教えて！』\nみたいな質問もあるでしょ？", "zh": "可是也有“Q.请告诉我结婚后理想的第1天！”这样的提问吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "7037baf0ecc885d35d905420352f566bf140c619d4c888e7b081a0a0e9c2816a", "ja": "相手も想像で、理想の一日も想像ってなると、\nなんだか頭がこんがらがってくるぞ～！", "zh": "如果连对方也是想象的，理想的一天也是想象的，就感觉脑子都要糊涂了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "d9ca8e8b75703547a32ce9ee82a82569e4994295306bb62db806e278702e4d00", "ja": "もはや想像というより、創作に近い気がします。\n……七尾さんレベルの想像力が必要だぞ。", "zh": "与其说是想象，我觉得已经更接近创作了。\n……这得需要七尾同学那种程度的想象力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "9121602305caf9246733389e683500cbb81a16f94a3602b1f3957bd1bc5cd1ed", "ja": "私は、{$P$}に\n置き換えて想像してたかも？", "zh": "我可能是把它替换成{$P$}来想象的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "48d71d2b153b2a9919dc6b1c11a94dcde7741a1cd83e058adf8fcaf95ae0772f", "ja": "だって、毎日一緒に過ごす相手でしょ？　家族以外だと\nみんなと{$P$}しかいないし。", "zh": "毕竟是每天都会一起度过时光的人嘛？除了家人，也就只有大家和{$P$}了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "01bdcf2cac0b403b3509a770193cac5736631c6851595ca81cd56f1610d5e5c8", "ja": "一緒に何かするのも、想像しやすいかな？って！", "zh": "一起做些什么的话，也会更容易想象吧？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "937e60b69a93eb17119e040c934b9b7223c59eb8dc8cd090606f14289f8716db", "ja": "確かに……。{$P$}に\n置き換えたら、考えやすいかも！", "zh": "确实……。换成{$P$}\n来想的话，可能更容易考虑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "83bd4cc251ffd03c7d97ef1e53c2830a85d454dcab717830be00b3cdee515bda", "ja": "ある程度、具体性がないと答えられない\n質問もありますからね～。", "zh": "毕竟有些问题，\n不具体到一定程度就没法回答呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8c4cc26c8cb8f1bb69ffce825849cc2b8987a21e97100d3999691a09596ff16", "ja": "ほんなら、{$P$}さんは私ら\n全員の相手役ってことやな！　役得ですね♪", "zh": "那样的话，{$P$}先生就是我们所有人的对手戏对象了！真是占便宜呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e2ede12c0d06afb4db82fcb98dad3118a15d1fb5461746c2c9aea2af9cfa7eb1", "ja": "大人をからかわないように……。\nその方が答えやすい質問の時は、それで構わないけど。", "zh": "别戏弄大人啊……\n不过，要是那样比较容易回答提问的话，倒是无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "d74c4e73644ca405a6e002b87642a924d673b6f1c234ed5fec585fcc6d537338", "ja": "許可が出たので、{$P$}を\n代入して回答しましょう。……あくまでお仕事、だぞ。", "zh": "既然获得了许可，就把{$P$}代入进去来回答吧。……不过这终究是工作，知道吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1023_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "127a1935299c49f4dfca8e62d73df4517d12c2c5b1247825179ec0aaa52415a1", "ja": "次は『Q.理想の結婚式は？』……これは式場の\nカタログ見て、好みのもの選べばええんかな？", "zh": "接下来是“Q.理想中的婚礼是什么样的？”……这个是不是看看婚礼场地的目录，选自己喜欢的就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "4a9ac1b8c61016eb11a78545d404290ac7dd16a173141fc70db58d2f2bef5af4", "ja": "教会式に神前式、他にも色々ありますね～。\nどれも素敵で、悩ましいですな～。", "zh": "教会式、神前式，此外还有很多种呢～。\n每一个都很棒，真让人难以抉择呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "a692500322340732a5d417778b77e91c1acd1ada8bff82fe1166ed81eab5602d", "ja": "これって、ひとつ選ばなくちゃなの？　いろんな結婚式\nやるのはダメなのかな？　トライアスロンみたいに。", "zh": "这下必须选一个吗？各种各样的婚礼都办一遍不行吗？就像铁人三项那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "04e80716d33053a45c3e8847df8c6bd8f39f8babd8d257fa2162a403ce6e5832", "ja": "トライアスロン……お色直しはあると思うけど……。\n海美はいろんな種類の結婚式を体験したいのか？", "zh": "铁人三项……我觉得应该会有换装环节，不过……海美是想体验各种不同类型的婚礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "40322e15491e27c0d59ea2c3d5fafe3fb99d590f78da067af9c365b3e6e2e357", "ja": "種類もだけど、お祝いなら思いっきり楽しくしたい！\nだって、一生一緒にいる人なんでしょ！？", "zh": "不只是种类，既然是庆祝，就要尽情热闹才行！因为那可是要一辈子在一起的人，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "01ca0594450d088408b5af530b57f8edee69657f09536cbf8259de695183d288", "ja": "一緒にいられてとっても幸せだよ～って、気が済むまで\nお祝いしたいの！　毎年だっていいくらい☆", "zh": "我想一直庆祝到尽兴为止，大声告诉你“能和你在一起，我真的特别幸福哦～”！每年庆祝一次都不嫌多呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "17b61e9ae098fa5e75d06df8a5fdabe28614fcc5a3d5700a2927366b71ff1035", "ja": "毎年……それは、結婚の周年ごとにお祝いする、\n紙婚式や銀婚式というものがありますね。", "zh": "每年……也就是说，有纸婚、银婚之类按结婚周年来庆祝的纪念日吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "f97daf2a3fe3ed1bb19035da9ebec00d899a1f3d07f47f9d76b8a109ab02ec24", "ja": "たしか、15年目くらいまでは毎年設定されて\nいるはずです。……特別な記念日。", "zh": "我记得，直到大约第15年为止，应该每年都有这样的特别纪念日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "778de47712a0c05bd995983d3da800feac60a0bd688232398106b69ef81f673f", "ja": "そうなんだ！　それじゃあ、結婚式も記念日も\n思いっきりお祝いしたいって書こうっと！", "zh": "原来如此！那我就写上“婚礼和纪念日都要尽情庆祝”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "6d248feac0e81b610d4161b67e14329f0cd3b7d2352497a36247ccf5ca8b15ba", "ja": "（金婚式とかは結婚記念日であって、\n挙式するわけではないとは思うけど……）", "zh": "（我想金婚式之类的应该是结婚纪念日，并不是要举行婚礼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b4261eeac1b6edd364257abd3ae4f8d28d6a51553b5672791a179b4eba7fa155", "ja": "（ま、こういう夢いっぱいな感じも年頃らしさかな。\nこの調子で、思うまま答えてもらおう！）", "zh": "（嘛，这种充满梦想的感觉，也很符合这个年纪嘛。\n就照这样，让她随心所欲地回答吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "9bad825ccd0a7f1b7ce2bf6ce13e7e04dd557db905b327eda9f767c3fdf45606", "ja": "あ、リゾートウェディングっていうのもあるんだ。\n人気なのはやっぱり沖縄……へえ～！", "zh": "啊，原来还有叫作度假婚礼的啊。最受欢迎的果然还是冲绳……哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "97e2213aeb0ac350dcc478b266d89f471fb0ca62ed2aadbbb7b8270235e7e071", "ja": "自分も、結婚式をするなら沖縄がいいな！\n家族もたくさん呼んで、盛大にやるんだ！", "zh": "我也是，要办婚礼的话，我想选冲绳！还要叫上很多家人，办得热热闹闹的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "cdf766d2700598c7b1802854666c4b6e454ac8919a6df30ab65bc1f86833fc48", "ja": "いわゆるオーシャンビュー、海の見えるチャペルは\n特に人気が高いようですね。", "zh": "所谓的海景教堂，也就是能看到大海的教堂，似乎尤其受欢迎呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "f221d0d8a355ea3a8337d47621ca062a0ef861abfb99b0796f1efce7cd237b53", "ja": "素敵ですね～。私は、こぢんまりした\nホームパーティー形式も捨てがたいです～。", "zh": "真棒呢～。不过，小巧温馨的家庭聚会形式也让人难以割舍呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "f066ad3c74126287a7b94fcbb619b7cad22b69b940446abf15c0a16287246c47", "ja": "あっ、わかる！　仲いい友達集めて\nアットホームなパーティーもええやんな！", "zh": "啊，我懂！把关系好的朋友们聚在一起，办一场温馨的派对也很不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "ba1eaa4a52a91010a785a4feedd50524196b3851c4733de5e2cf0948fe208da1", "ja": "堅苦しい式とかやっても、\n私の場合肩凝ってしまいそうで……。", "zh": "要是办那些死板规矩的仪式，\n我感觉自己肯定会浑身不自在的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "f3b4768bee9f61f87d2e87b1f2a5464d77eac6dfc6ec38037c7246f62b34d813", "ja": "お金もかかりますしね～。だったら、\n旅行に行ったり、新居のために使うのもありかと～。", "zh": "还要花钱呢～。既然这样，拿去旅行，或者用来置办新家也不错～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "8d31c90cb91407fc1aabb209f0687b32a58e5fbcdd389f79a30d7fc4e1a58210", "ja": "式だけでなく、その後の生活まで考えているとは。\n宮尾さん、流石です。", "zh": "不仅考虑了婚礼，连之后的生活也规划到了。\n宫尾同学，真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "b66d7d0ea7b6dac15391e0c4d131ea1c63b02c6d089a7efeadcd75fe4868974e", "ja": "それほどでも～。\nシミュレーションはばっちりですよ～、むふふ。", "zh": "没那么夸张啦～\n模拟得可是相当完美哦～，唔呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "7a7428230051ee2def19fce374112c472734b734da9c374456274f52a20a5dfd", "ja": "（話は盛り上がったまま、止む気配がない……。\n今日で一気にアンケートが進むといいな！）", "zh": "（话题依旧热烈，完全没有要停下来的迹象……希望今天能一口气推进问卷调查就好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
